{
  "description": "Application pursuant to Section 96A of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) to make non-material amendments to Reserved Matters Approval 21/1181/RMA dated 18/06/2021 for the development of Plot 46 (Replacement Claremont Primary School) and the School Green Corridor within Phase 2 (South) (School) sub-phase of planning permission F/04687/13 dated 23/07/2014 (as amended) for the comprehensive mixed-use redevelopment of the Brent Cross Cricklewood Regeneration Area. Amendments are sought to the description of development and to Conditions 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 11, 12 and 13, alongside the addition of four new conditions to the decision notice relating to the introduction of a phased delivery of the development; reconfiguration of the building and site layout; changes to building form,  height and massing; reorganisation of the internal layout; relocation of the Hall Block and revision to arrival sequence; repositioning of the Main Teaching Block and revised building setbacks; amendments to main entrance, frontage and boundary treatments; internalisation of external staircase; amendments to landscape design; and adoption of an all-electric energy strategy for the site.",
